title: "Replication package: Water-stress and grid-carbon exposure of new AI data centre capacity"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Ali
    given-names: Suhan
    affiliation: "Lahore Grammar School, Lahore, Pakistan"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0004-5079-7684"
date-released: 2026-10-27
version: "1.1.0"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Code and data behind the paper "Water-Stress and Grid-Carbon Exposure of New
  AI Data Centre Capacity against Population and Grid Benchmarks, with Emissions
  Projected to 2031": a benchmarked siting analysis of 5,254 data centres and 94
  large AI campuses against water stress (WRI Aqueduct 4.0 and a monthly
  water-gap metric), average and marginal grid carbon intensity, an illustrative
  pre-approval screen, and a calibrated projection of data centre energy,
  emissions and water to 2031.
keywords:
  - data centres
  - artificial intelligence
  - water stress
  - grid carbon intensity
  - marginal emissions
  - environmental impact assessment
  - siting
